      "question_type_code": "T-FORM-CHOICE",
      "grammar_point_code": "CONJ_PARALLEL",
      "stem": "다음은 위 지문의 일부이다. (a), (b), (c)에 들어갈 어형으로 알맞게 짝지어진 것을 고르시오.\n\nNick Priest saw a car accident and (a)[ran / running] to save the children on the bus. ... He spends his free time (b)[fixing / to fix] old cars and (c)[donating / donate] them to people in need.",
